10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Spray</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">FOUNDATION</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Melatonin</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Single-ingredient melatonin for sleep cycle support and jet lag management.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Melatonin</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">LIPOSOMAL</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Liposomal Melatonin Spray</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Fast-acting liposomal delivery in an oral spray format for rapid onset.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Liposomal</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Melatonin</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Spray</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">RELAXATION</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">L-Theanine</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Amino acid that increases relaxation and soothes the central nervous system.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">L-Theanine</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Relaxation</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M21 8.25c0-2.49-2.02-4.5-4.5-4.5-1.83 0-3.4 1.09-4.13 2.66A4.49 4.49 0 0 0 7.5 3.75 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3 8.25c0 6.97 9 12 9 12s9-5.03 9-12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">STRESS</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Cortisol Benefits™</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Formulated to support healthy cortisol levels for restful sleep and stress balance.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Adaptogens</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Cortisol Support</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">BOTANICAL</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Ashwagandha & Valerian Root</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Traditional botanicals supporting deeper sleep and faster sleep onset.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Ashwagandha</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Valerian</span></div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609515,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/Private%20Label/Images/Role_of_Sleep_Supplements_in_Health.jpg\" alt=\"Sleep supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHY DAVINCI FOR SLEEP</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Premium ingredients, scientifically backed, format-flexible.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">Our sleep supplements use premium melatonin, herbs, and other ingredients. Our R&D team consults with expert researchers before formulating new products, so you can confidently market scientifically backed sleep support. With capsule, chewable, and liquid spray formats available, you can serve every type of sleep customer under one brand.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609516,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Build across multiple health categories</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">Most brands start with one category and expand. Combine sleep with adjacent categories to grow lifetime value per customer.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <a href=\"/private-label-fitness\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/fitnesssupps.png\" alt=\"Fitness\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Fitness</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-herbal\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/herbalsupps.png\" alt=\"Herbal\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Herbal</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-aging\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/agingsupps.png\" alt=\"Aging\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Aging</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-womens-health\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/womenssupps.png\" alt=\"Women's Health\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Women's Health</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-probiotics\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/probioticsupps.png\" alt=\"Probiotics\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Probiotics</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-weight-loss\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/weightsupps.png\" alt=\"Weight Management\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Weight Management</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609517,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px; text-align: center;\">\n  <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; margin: 0;\">\n    Looking for the complete catalog of available formulations?\n    <a href=\"https://www.davincilabs.com/product-guide\" style=\"color: #6BA644; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 6px;\">Explore the Product Guide &rarr;</a>\n  </p>\n</div>"},"id":216201609518,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your sleep supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation and we will walk through your audience, the right sleep formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline. Most brands launch within 3 to 4 weeks of approving labels, 8 to 12 weeks from first conversation.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609519,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/Private%20Label%20Guide%20ToF.jpg\" alt=\"The Definitive Guide to Private Labeling Supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(1,38,56,.15);\"/>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">NEW TO PRIVATE LABEL</p>\n      <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Get the free Definitive Guide to Private Labeling</h2>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 28px;\">If you are new to private labeling supplements and want to learn more about how to build your brand with our manufacturing team, download our free Definitive Guide. You will get answers to the most frequently asked questions about private labeling, plus tips and step-by-step instructions to make your new product launch easy, successful, and profitable.</p>\n      <a href=\"/guide-definitive-private-label\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Download the Guide</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609520,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609521,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What does private labeling sleep support supplements actually involve?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Private labeling means you launch a sleep support product under your own brand using one of our pre-existing, doctor-formulated stock formulas. We handle manufacturing, quality testing, and bottling. You select the formulation from our catalog, design your label, and we produce the finished product ready to ship under your brand. No formulation work, no setup fees, no lab build-out.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What are typical minimums and lead times for sleep support products?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Most sleep support formulations have minimum order quantities in the low hundreds of bottles per SKU. Once your labels are approved, production typically takes three to four weeks before your first inventory ships. Custom packaging or formulation can extend that timeline. We give you exact MOQs and lead times for the SKUs you select during your consultation.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I customize the formulations or only the label?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Both paths are available. Private label means you use our existing sleep support formulations as-is and put your brand on them. Custom formulation means our R&D team develops new sleep support formulas to your exact specifications, with full proprietary ownership of the result. Custom carries higher minimums and longer timelines but gives you a real moat. Most clients start with private label and add custom formulations once they have traction.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Are these sleep support products FDA-compliant?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. All our sleep support formulations are manufactured in our FDA-registered, GMP-certified Vermont facility. Our formulations meet dietary supplement labeling requirements under DSHEA. Each batch is tested for identity, potency, and contaminants. You receive Certificates of Analysis with your inventory. We help you understand the structure-function claims you can responsibly make on your label.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What if I need a sleep support formulation that is not in your catalog?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">That is where custom formulation comes in. Our R&D team has developed hundreds of sleep support formulations over the past 50 years. If your concept is doable within DSHEA and our manufacturing capabilities, we can build it. Custom formulation projects typically take 12 to 16 weeks from concept to production-ready, with higher minimums to amortize the R&D investment.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>How much does it cost to launch a sleep support private label line?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Total launch cost depends on the SKUs you choose, the packaging you select, and the volume you order. Most clients launch a 3-5 SKU sleep support line for under $15,000 in initial inventory, including custom label design. There are no setup fees, no annual contracts, and no formulation costs for private label. We provide transparent SKU-by-SKU pricing during your consultation.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609522,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; padding: 28px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; letter-spacing: .2px;\">\n      These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Information on this site is provided for informational purposes only and is not intended as a substitute for advice from your physician or other health care professional.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609523,"type":"rich_text"}]}},"widgets":{}}